# Spotify PKCE OAuth credentials (optional — harmonic matching only)
# Register your app at https://developer.spotify.com/dashboard
# Add "dialed://spotify-callback" as a Redirect URI in your app settings.
#
# PKCE uses only the PUBLIC client ID — no client secret is stored on-device.
#
# Rename this file to .env and fill in your value.

EXPO_PUBLIC_SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID=your_client_id_here
